\f1\fs22 Janine could hear the music before she opened her car door. It sounded like gorillas throwing barnyard animals and kitchen utensils down a fire escape. Also there was an undercurrent of building collapse, and Janine couldn\'92t figure whether it was on the recording or the house breaking up in sympathetic  4/4 time.\
