\f1\fs22 Inside, she found the source of noise and attenuated it.\
\'93Hey!\'94 came the complaint from a room three walls away. \'93I was listening to that.\'94\
Janine raised her voice to the ceiling. \'93So was I.  And I hadn\'92t given my enthusiastic consent.\'94 She went to the family room and dropped her back on the couch. Pin Cushion was still riding, fast, like she was sprinting in a velodrome.\
